# Anchor Store: Dead Mall, track 1 (SPEC 19.7). A loop through the gutted
# department store: the long menswear aisle (mannequins still in rows),
# down the east side past the rack rows rolled into the fitting rooms,
# the perfume hall at the bottom where the runaway scrubber still crosses
# on its route, then up into the store's middle and round the escalator
# well before the line. Department-store carpet underfoot; the cleaners'
# wet floor never dried on the east aisle.
# Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i apply to the
# segment from point i to i+1; a segment without `open` has walls.
name ANCHOR STORE
order 1
floor carpet
background store
league dead_mall
width 50
# x    y    half   features
 250  140   54                     # start line, heading east
 520  125   54     crates          # menswear aisle: four crates
 790  140   52
 900  270   48
 905  480   46     coolant         # east aisle: wet floor
 875  690   46
 780  860   50
 560  900   52     sweeper,period=660,speed=36   # the perfume hall: the scrubber's route
 380  895   52
 260  800   48
 300  650   46
 470  610   46                     # through the store's middle
 690  570   46
 730  410   44
 580  330   44     crates          # round the escalator well
 400  380   46
 270  460   46     bay:right       # past the stock room: the service bay
 150  390   48
 140  250   50
# Props: mannequin rows beyond the menswear aisle's walls, racks down the
# east side, a neon sign at the corners, carts and palms by the hall.
props mannequin seg 1 side both gap 64 off 22
props rack seg 4 side right gap 70 off 22
props neon,palm seg 6 side both gap 90 off 24
props cart,palm seg 8 side left gap 80 off 22
props rack seg 12 side left gap 80 off 22
